<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cuff</h1>
<p>SKILL (hand cuffing), for members of the police guild
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cuff &lt;criminal&gt;
</pre>
<p>Members of the police guild learn hand cuffing at the police in Midgaard (see 
<a cmd='#'>Help Police Guild</a>). With it, a deputy can put the handcuffs on a wanted 
criminal and take them to jail. It only works on someone who is wanted, and 
it can fail: the better your hand cuffing against theirs, the better your 
chance. A criminal in cuffs can try to break them (see <a cmd='#'>Help Break</a>).
</p><p>A deputy who breaks the law and is caught is thrown out of the police guild, 
and loses the hand cuffing skill.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Police Guild</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Arrests</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Break</a>
</pre>




</div>